msgstr ":doc:`Axivoxモバイル統合 <../devices_integrations>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/manage_users.rst:252
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`SIP Identifiers` tab, the :guilabel:`SIP username` "
"field represents the user's information that was entered in "
"the :guilabel:`Extension` field, under the :guilabel:`General` tab."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`SIP識別子`\\ タブの下にある\\ :guilabel:`SIPユーザ名`\\ フィー"
"ルドは、\\ :guilabel:`一般`\\ タブの\\ :guilabel:`内線番号`\\ フィールドに入"
"力されたユーザ情報を表します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/manage_users.rst:255
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Domain` field is assigned to the company by the Axivox "
"representative."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`ドメイン`\\ フィールドは、Axivox担当者によって会社に割り当てら"
"れます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/manage_users.rst:257
msgid ""
"The value in the :guilabel:`SIP Password` field is unique for every Axivox "
"user. This value is used to sign into Axivox on Odoo, and for any "
"mobile :abbr:`SIP (Session Initiation Protocol)` clients."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`SIPパスワード`\\ フィールドの値は、各Axivoxユーザに固有です。こ"
"の値は、OdooでAxivoxにサインインする際、およびモバイル\\ :abbr:`SIP (Session "
"Initiation Protocol)`\\ クライアントで使用されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/manage_users.rst:260
msgid "Important credentials used for external configurations of Axivox VoIP."
msgstr "AxivoxのVoIP外部設定に使用される重要な認証情報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/manage_users.rst:264
msgid ""
"The value listed in the :guilabel:`Address of the proxy server` field is "
"typically: `pabx.axivox.com`, but is subject to change by Axivox, so be sure "
"to check the :guilabel:`SIP Identifiers` tab for the most accurate value."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`プロキシサーバのアドレス`\\ フィールドに記載されている値は、通"
