"document>` by one or more signers using drag-and-drop fields"
msgstr ""
"ドラッグアンドドロップフィールドを使用して、1人以上の署名者による\\ :ref:`署"
"名用ドキュメントの準備 <sign/request-signatures/prepare-document>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:29
msgid ""
"send :ref:`one-off documents for signing <sign/request-signatures/one-off>` "
"from the Sign app or from an Odoo record"
msgstr ""
"署名アプリまたはOdooレコードから\\ :ref:`1回限りのドキュメントを署名用に送信 "
"<sign/request-signatures/one-off>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:31
msgid ""
"create and use :ref:`templates <sign/request-signatures/templates>` to send "
"frequently used documents for signing from the Sign app or from an Odoo "
"record"
msgstr ""
"署名アプリまたはOdooレコードから頻繁に使用するドキュメントを署名用に送信する"
"ために\\ :ref:`テンプレート <sign/request-signatures/templates>`\\ を作成して"
"使用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:33
msgid ""
"create :ref:`document envelopes <sign/request-signatures/create-envelope>` "
"to send multiple documents in a single signature request or sign multiple "
"documents at the same time"
msgstr ""
"複数のドキュメントを単一の署名申請で送信したり、複数のドキュメントに同時に署"
"名したりするための\\ :ref:`ドキュメントエンベロープの作成 <sign/request-"
"signatures/create-envelope>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:35
msgid ""
":ref:`sign documents that have been prepared using Odoo Sign <sign/sign-"
"document/signature-request>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Odoo\\ 署名を使用して準備されたドキュメントに署名 <sign/sign-document/"
"signature-request>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:37
msgid ""
":ref:`sign non-prepared documents <sign/sign-document/pdf-document>` from "
"the Sign app, from the chatter of an Odoo record, or from "
"the :doc:`Documents <documents>` app"
msgstr ""
"署名アプリ、Odooレコードのチャッター、または\\ :doc:`ドキュメント "
"<documents>`\\ アプリから\\ :ref:`準備されていないドキュメントに署名 <sign/"
"sign-document/pdf-document>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:39
msgid ""
"configure :ref:`auto-complete fields <sign/configuration/auto-fill>` that "
