msgstr ""
"署名中にデータベースからデータが自動入力される\\ :ref:`自動入力フィールドの設"
"定 <sign/configuration/auto-fill>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:41
msgid ""
"define :ref:`advanced configuration for signers <sign/request-signatures/"
"signer-settings>` to require authentication (via SMS, Aadhaar eSign, or "
"itsme®), allow delegation, or, for templates, assign a fixed signer"
msgstr ""
"認証（SMS、Aadhaar eSign、またはitsme®経由）の要求、委任の許可、またはテンプ"
"レートの場合は固定署名者の割り当てを行うための\\ :ref:`署名者の詳細設定の定"
"義 <sign/request-signatures/signer-settings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:46
msgid "`Odoo Sign: product page <https://www.odoo.com/app/sign>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 署名: プロダクトページ <https://www.odoo.com/app/sign>`_"

