msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Sign --> Configuration --> Settings`\\ に移動"
"し、:guilabel:`Sign Default Terms & Conditions`\\ を有効にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:42
msgid "Choose the desired option:"
msgstr "希望するオプションを選択します："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/configuration.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Terms in Email`: This option is selected by default and places "
"the terms and conditions at the bottom of the signature request email. Add "
"your terms and conditions to the text box."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Terms in Email`：このオプションはデフォルトで選択されており、取引"
