#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:134
msgid ""
"When you open a template that has already been used to send a signature "
"request, the template is in :guilabel:`View only mode`. Click :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`Duplicate & Edit` to create a copy of the template, which "
