"定 <sign/request-signatures/template-form>`にアクセスして編集します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:166
msgid ""
"To replace a document in the template, such as with an updated version, "
"while preserving the fields already added, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) icon next to the relevant document, "
"select :guilabel:`Replace document`, choose the new document, then "
"click :guilabel:`Replace document`."
msgstr ""
