"書を選択した後、「:guilabel:`文書を置換`」をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:171
msgid ""
"Each replacement creates a duplicate of the template with the fields placed "
"at the same position as in the original. If the new document has a different "
"layout or added text, the fields may no longer align "
"correctly. :ref:`Reposition them <sign/request-signatures/add-fields-edit>` "
"as needed."
msgstr ""
