msgstr ""
"ドキュメントを署名用に準備するには、各署名者に\\ :ref:`関連フィールドを追加 "
"<sign/request-signatures/add-fields>`\\ します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:384
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:576
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert.rst:40
msgid "It is also possible to:"
