#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:393
msgid "Add fields to a document"
msgstr "ドキュメントにフィールドを追加"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:395
msgid ""
"To add a field to a document, drag it from the left panel and drop it in the "
"appropriate place in the document."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントにフィールドを追加するには、左パネルからフィールドをドラッグし、"
"ドキュメント内の適切な場所にドロップします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:399
msgid ""
"Various fields are available by default. These fields can be :ref:`edited "
"and additional fields can be created <sign/configuration/create-edit-"
"fields>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトで様々なフィールドが利用可能です。必要に応じて、これらのフィールド"
"は\\ :ref:`編集可能で、追加のフィールドを作成 <sign/configuration/create-"
"edit-fields>`\\ できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:402
msgid ""
"Fields of the following :ref:`field types <sign/configuration/field-types>` "
"require some additional configuration when they are added to a document:"
msgstr ""
"次の\\ :ref:`フィールドタイプ <sign/configuration/field-types>`\\ のフィール"
"ドは、ドキュメントに追加する際に追加の設定が必要です:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:405
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Initial`: When adding this field to a multi-page document, choose "
"whether to add it to all pages of the document, or only the current page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`イニシャル`：複数ページのドキュメントにこのフィールドを追加する場"
"合、ドキュメントのすべてのページに追加するか、現在のページにのみ追加するかを"
"選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:407
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Radio`: By default, two radio buttons are added; there must "
"always be a minimum of two options. To increase or decrease the number of "
"options, click on one of the radio buttons, then under :guilabel:`Options`, "
"use the :icon:`fa-caret-up` :guilabel:`(increase)` or :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(decrease)` icons as needed. Each radio button can be "
"repositioned independently by clicking and dragging it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ラジオボタン`：デフォルトでは2つのラジオボタンが追加されます。常に"
"最低2つのオプションが必要です。オプション数を増減するには、いずれかのラジオボ"
"タンをクリックし、:guilabel:`オプション`\\ の下で、必要に応じて\\ :icon:`fa-"
"caret-up`\\ :guilabel:`（増加）`\\ または\\ :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down`\\ :guilabel:`（減少）`\\ アイコンを使用します。各ラジオボタンは、クリッ"
"クしてドラッグすることで個別に位置を変更できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:412
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Selection`: To define options, type each option on a new line in "
"the :guilabel:`Options` text box, ensuring you have pressed `Enter` after "
"each option. To delete options, remove the corresponding text from the text "
"box."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`選択`：オプションを定義するには、:guilabel:`オプション`\\ テキスト"
"ボックスに各オプションを新しい行に入力し、各オプションの後で必ず`Enter`キーを"
"押してください。オプションを削除するには、テキストボックスから該当するテキス"
"トを削除します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:415
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Strikethrough`: To use this field to allow signers to reject a "
"certain phrase or phrases, position the field on top of the relevant text by "
"dragging it. Ensure that the field is neither :guilabel:`Mandatory` "
"nor :guilabel:`Read-only` to allow the signer to freely decide which phrases "
"to reject."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:422
msgid "Once a field has been added, it is possible to:"
msgstr "フィールドが追加されると、次の操作が可能になります:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:424
msgid ""
"**Reposition the field**: Hover over the field until the :icon:`fa-hand-"
"paper-o` :guilabel:`(hand)` icon appears, then click and drag the field to "
"the desired position."
msgstr ""
"**フィールドの位置変更**：フィールドにカーソルを合わせて\\ :icon:`fa-hand-"
"paper-o`\\ :guilabel:`（手）`\\ アイコンが表示されたら、フィールドをクリック"
"して目的の位置にドラッグします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:428
msgid ""
"To reposition or duplicate multiple fields at once, select the fields by "
"drawing a selection area around them with your mouse. Then:"
msgstr ""
"複数のフィールドを一度に移動または複製するには、マウスで選択範囲を描いて"
"フィールドを選択します。次に:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:431
msgid ""
"to reposition the fields, hover over one of the selected fields until "
"the :icon:`fa-hand-paper-o` :guilabel:`(hand)` icon appears, then click and "
"drag the fields to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"フィールドを移動するには、選択したフィールドの1つにカーソルを合わせ"
"て:icon:`fa-hand-paper-o`\\ :guilabel:`手`\\ アイコンが表示されるまで待ち、"
"フィールドをクリックして目的の位置にドラッグします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:434
msgid ""
"to copy and paste the fields, use your regular keyboard shortcut to copy the "
"fields, place your cursor where you want to paste the fields, then use your "
"regular keyboard shortcut to paste them."
msgstr ""
"フィールドをコピー&ペーストするには、通常のキーボードショートカットを使用して"
"フィールドをコピーし、フィールドを貼り付けたい場所にカーソルを置いてから、通"
"常のキーボードショートカットを使用して貼り付けます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:438
msgid ""
"**Change the size of the field**: Hover over the bottom edge, right edge, or "
"bottom-right corner to reveal resize arrows. Drag the vertical or horizontal "
"resize arrows to adjust the height or width, respectively, or drag the "
"diagonal resize arrows to scale both dimensions simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"**フィールドのサイズ変更**：下端、右端、または右下隅にカーソルを合わせると、"
"サイズ変更矢印が表示されます。縦または横のサイズ変更矢印をドラッグして高さま"
"たは幅をそれぞれ調整するか、斜めのサイズ変更矢印をドラッグして両方の寸法を同"
"時に拡大縮小します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:443
msgid ""
"**Modify certain attributes of the field**: Click on the field to open it, "
"make the necessary changes, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"**フィールドの特定の属性を変更**：フィールドをクリックして開き、必要な変更を"
"行ってから、:guilabel:`保存`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:446
msgid ""
"Depending on the :ref:`field type <sign/configuration/field-types>`, "
"attributes that can be modified include:"
msgstr ""
"\\ :ref:`フィールドタイプ <sign/configuration/field-types>`\\ に応じて、変更"
"可能な属性は次のとおりです："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:449
msgid ""
"the :guilabel:`Placeholder` text, i.e., the temporary text the signer sees "
"before starting to complete the field"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`プレースホルダー`\\ テキスト、つまり署名者がフィールドへの入力を始"
"める前に表示される一時的なテキスト"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:451
msgid "whether or not a field is a :guilabel:`Mandatory field`"
msgstr "フィールドが\\ :guilabel:`必須フィールド`\\ であるかどうか"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:452
msgid "whether or not a field is :guilabel:`Read-only`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:453
msgid "the horizontal alignment of the text within the field"
msgstr "フィールド内のテキストの水平方向の配置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:456
msgid ""
"Any changes made to the attributes of a field after adding the field to a "
"document apply *to the current document only*. To make permanent changes to "
"the field, :ref:`edit the field <sign/configuration/create-edit-fields>`."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントにフィールドを追加した後にフィールドの属性に加えた変更は、*現在の"
"ドキュメントにのみ*適用されます。フィールドに恒久的な変更を加えるには、"
"\\ :ref:`フィールドを編集 <sign/configuration/create-edit-fields>`\\ してくだ"
"さい。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:460
msgid ""
"**Remove a field**: Click on the field to open it, then click :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`(remove)` to remove the field from the document."
msgstr ""
"**フィールドの削除**:フィールドをクリックして開き、:icon:`fa-"
"trash`\\ :guilabel:`削除`\\ をクリックして、ドキュメントからフィールドを削除"
"します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:463
msgid ""
"**Duplicate a field**: Click on the field to open it, then click :icon:`fa-"
"clone` :guilabel:`(duplicate)` to create a copy of the field. Alternatively, "
"use your regular keyboard shortcuts to copy and paste a field."
msgstr ""
"**フィールドの複製**:フィールドをクリックして開き、:icon:`fa-"
"clone`\\ :guilabel:`複製`\\ をクリックして、フィールドのコピーを作成します。"
"または、通常のキーボードショートカットを使用してフィールドをコピー&ペーストす"
"ることもできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:470
msgid "Document envelopes"
msgstr "ドキュメントエンベロープ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:472
msgid ""
"A document envelope allows for multiple documents to be signed at the same "
"time or sent for signing in a single signature request. It is possible to "
"create a one-off document envelope or a :ref:`template <sign/request-"
"signatures/templates>` based on a document envelope."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントエンベロープを使用すると、複数のドキュメントを同時に署名したり、1"
"つの署名申請で送信したりできます。1回限りのドキュメントエンベロープを作成する"
"ことも、ドキュメントエンベロープに基づいた:ref:`テンプレート <sign/request-"
"signatures/templates>`\\ を作成することもできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:476
msgid ""
"To create a document envelope *during* the initial file upload, after "
"clicking :guilabel:`Upload PDF`, select the relevant `.pdf` documents and "
"click :guilabel:`Open`."
msgstr ""
"最初のファイルアップロード時にドキュメントエンベロープを作成するに"
"は、:guilabel:`PDFをアップロード`\\ をクリックした後、該当する`.pdf`ドキュメ"
"ントを選択し、:guilabel:`開く`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:480
msgid ""
"If, when creating a document envelope via the Sign app, you need to include "
"one document saved in the Documents app, import that document *before* "
"adding subsequent documents. To do so, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon beside the name of the view, "
"then :guilabel:`Import from Documents`."
msgstr ""
"署名アプリでドキュメントエンベロープを作成する際に、ドキュメントアプリに保存"
"されているドキュメントを含める必要がある場合は、後続のドキュメントを追加する"
"前にそのドキュメントをインポートします。これを行うには、ビュー名の横にあ"
"る:icon:`fa-cog`\\ :guilabel:`アクション`\\ アイコンをクリックし、次"
"に:guilabel:`ドキュメントからインポート`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:485
msgid "To add one or more documents *after* the initial file upload:"
msgstr "最初のファイルアップロード後に1つ以上のドキュメントを追加するには:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:487
msgid ""
"Open the initial document or document envelope, then click :guilabel:`Add` "
"in the :guilabel:`Documents` section."
msgstr ""
"最初のドキュメントまたはドキュメントエンベロープを開き、:guilabel:`ドキュメン"
"ト`\\ セクションで:guilabel:`追加`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:492
msgid ""
"To change the order in which documents are presented to the signer, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon beside the "
"relevant document in the :guilabel:`Documents` section, then click :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-up` :guilabel:`Move Up` or :icon:`fa-arrow-down` :guilabel:`Move Down` "
"as appropriate. To remove a document from the envelope, click :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr ""
"署名者に提示されるドキュメントの順序を変更するには、:guilabel:`ドキュメント"
"`\\ セクションで該当するドキュメントの横にある:icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v`\\ :guilabel:`縦の省略記号`\\ アイコンをクリックし、必要に応じて:icon:`fa-"
"arrow-up`\\ :guilabel:`上に移動`\\ または:icon:`fa-arrow-down`\\ :guilabel:`"
"下に移動`\\ をクリックします。エンベロープからドキュメントを削除するに"
"は、:icon:`fa-trash`\\ :guilabel:`削除`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:498
msgid "Document envelope with two documents"
msgstr "2つのドキュメントを含むドキュメントエンベロープ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:504
msgid "Add and configure signers"
msgstr "署名者の追加と設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:506
msgid ""
"By default, a document or document envelope has one signer. "
"Additional :ref:`signers can be added <sign/request-signatures/add-signers>` "
"and :ref:`advanced configuration can be defined <sign/request-signatures/"
"signer-settings>` for one or more signers."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、ドキュメントまたはドキュメント封筒には1人の署名者がいます。追"
"加の\\ :ref:`署名者を追加 <sign/request-signatures/add-signers>`\\ でき、1人"
"以上の署名者に対して\\ :ref:`高度な設定を定義 <sign/request-signatures/"
"signer-settings>`\\ できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:513
msgid "Add signers"
msgstr "署名者の追加"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:515
msgid "To add additional signers to a document or document envelope:"
msgstr "ドキュメントまたはドキュメントエンベロープに署名者を追加するには:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:517
msgid ""
"Open the document or document envelope, then click :guilabel:`Add` in "
"the :guilabel:`Signers` section."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントまたはドキュメントエンベロープを開き、:guilabel:`署名者`\\ セク"
"ションで:guilabel:`追加`\\ をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:519
msgid ""
"Optionally, edit the name of the signer by hovering over the name, e.g., "
"`Signer 2`, clicking the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(pencil)` icon, then "
"typing the new name."
msgstr ""
"オプションで、署名者の名前にカーソルを合わせ、例えば`署名者 2`の:icon:`fa-"
"pencil`\\ :guilabel:`鉛筆`\\ アイコンをクリックし、新しい名前を入力して、署名"
"者の名前を編集します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:522
msgid "Editing the name of signers"
msgstr "署名者の名前の編集"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:526
msgid ""
"Each signer is assigned a unique color and all fields associated with a "
"specific signer have the same background color."
msgstr ""
"各署名者には固有の色が割り当てられ、特定の署名者に関連するすべてのフィールド"
"は同じ背景色になります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:528
msgid ""
"When a document or document envelope has multiple signers, it is possible to "
"define the order in which signers receive and sign when :ref:`configuring "
"the signature request <sign/request-signatures/configure-request>`."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントまたはドキュメント封筒に複数の署名者がいる場合、\\ :ref:`署名申請"
"を設定 <sign/request-signatures/configure-request>`\\ する際に、署名者が受信"
"して署名する順序を定義できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:535
msgid "Signer settings"
msgstr "署名者設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:537
msgid ""
"To define additional configuration for signers, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon on the row of the signer. For each "
"signer, the following options are available:"
msgstr ""
"署名者の追加設定を定義するには、署名者の行にある\\ :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v`\\ :guilabel:`(縦の省略記号)`\\ アイコンをクリックします。各署名者に対し"
"て、次のオプションを使用できます："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:540
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Authentication Step`: Require the signer "
"to :ref:`authenticate using a specific authentication method <sign/security/"
"authentication>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:542
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Can delegate`: Allow the signer to :ref:`delegate their signature "
"<sign/sign-document/delegate>` or :ref:`be replaced after the signature "
"request has been sent <sign/request-signatures/change-signers>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:545
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Assign to`: Assign a specific contact as signer by selecting them "
"from the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`割り当て先`\\ ：ドロップダウンから特定の連絡先を選択して署名者"
"として割り当てます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:550
msgid "Add tags"
msgstr "タグを追加"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:552
msgid ""
"To add :ref:`tags <sign/configuration/tags>` to a document or document "
"envelope *before sending a signature request*, select the relevant tags from "
"the :guilabel:`Tags` dropdown in the upper-right corner above the document."
msgstr ""
"*署名申請を送信する前*\\ にドキュメントまたはドキュメントエンベロープに"
"\\ :ref:`タグ <sign/configuration/tags>`\\ を追加するには、ドキュメント上部右"
"隅の\\ :guilabel:`タグ`\\ ドロップダウンから関連するタグを選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:556
msgid ""
"Tags can also be added to, or removed from, a document :ref:`after a "
"signature request has been sent <sign/request-signatures/manage-form>`."
msgstr ""
"タグは、\\ :ref:`署名申請が送信された後 <sign/request-signatures/manage-"
"form>`\\ にドキュメントに追加または削除することもできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:562
msgid "Configure the signature request"
msgstr "署名申請を設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:564
msgid ""
"After :ref:`preparing a one-off document or document envelope for signing "
"<sign/request-signatures/prepare-document>` or selecting a template, "
"click :guilabel:`Send`, then configure the signature request in "
"the :guilabel:`New Signature Request` window."
msgstr ""
"\\ :ref:`1回限りのドキュメントまたはドキュメント封筒を署名用に準備 <sign/"
"request-signatures/prepare-document>`\\ した後、またはテンプレートを選択した"
"後、\\ :guilabel:`送信`\\ をクリックし、\\ :guilabel:`新規署名申請`\\ ウィン"
"ドウで署名申請を設定します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:568
msgid ""
"For each signer, select a contact or type an email address. Optionally, "
"enable :ref:`Signing Order <sign/request-signatures/signing-order>` to "
"control the order in which the document or document envelope is signed."
msgstr ""
"各署名者について、連絡先を選択するか、メールアドレスを入力します。オプション"
"で、\\ :ref:`署名順序 <sign/request-signatures/signing-order>`\\ を有効にし"
"て、ドキュメントまたはドキュメント封筒が署名される順序を制御します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:573
msgid ""
"A signer's email address can be :ref:`modified after the signature request "
"has been sent <sign/request-signatures/change-signers>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"必要に応じて、署名者のメールアドレスは\\ :ref:`署名申請が送信された後に変更 "
"<sign/request-signatures/change-signers>`\\ できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:578
msgid ""
":ref:`set a Valid Until date <sign/request-signatures/validity>` after which "
"the signature request expires"
msgstr ""
"署名申請が期限切れになる\\ :ref:`有効期限日を設定 <sign/request-signatures/"
"validity>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:580
msgid ""
":ref:`set Reminders <sign/request-signatures/validity>` to be sent at fixed "
"intervals"
msgstr ""
"一定の間隔で送信される\\ :ref:`リマインダーを設定 <sign/request-signatures/"
"validity>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:581
msgid ""
"enable :guilabel:`Hide certificate key on pages` to hide the :ref:`reference "
"of the certificate of completion <sign/security/certificate-of-completion>` "
"displayed by default on each page of the document(s)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:584
msgid ""
"have one or more parties notified when the document is fully signed "
"or :ref:`refused <sign/sign-document/decline>` by adding the relevant "
"contact(s) or email address(es) in the :guilabel:`CC` field"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:588
msgid "add a message to the signature request email"
msgstr "署名申請メールにメッセージを追加"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:591
msgid ""
"When :ref:`creating a template <sign/request-signatures/templates>`, it is "
"possible to define a default message to be added to the signature request; "
"this can still be edited before sending."
msgstr ""
"\\ :ref:`テンプレートを作成 <sign/request-signatures/templates>`\\ する際、署"
"名申請に追加されるデフォルトのメッセージを定義できます。これは送信前に編集で"
"きます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:595
msgid ""
"add attachments to the signature request via the :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`(paperclip)` icon at the bottom of the window, or, to "
"add an attachment saved in the Documents app, click the Documents app icon"
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウ下部の\\ :icon:`fa-paperclip`\\ （:guilabel:`クリップ`）アイコンか"
"ら署名申請に添付ファイルを追加するか、またはドキュメントアプリに保存された添"
"付ファイルを追加するには、ドキュメントアプリアイコンをクリックします"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:598
msgid ""
"schedule the sending of the signature request via the :icon:`fa-clock-"
"o` :guilabel:`(clock)` icon"
msgstr ""
"\\ :icon:`fa-clock-o`\\ （:guilabel:`時計`）アイコンから署名申請の送信をスケ"
"ジュールします"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:603
msgid "Signing order"
msgstr "署名順序"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:605
msgid ""
"When a document or document envelope needs to be signed by multiple parties, "
"and the order of signing is important, it is possible to define "
"the :guilabel:`Signing order` when configuring the signature request. This "
"controls the order in which the recipients receive the document(s) for "
"signature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:610
msgid "To define a signing order:"
msgstr "署名順序を定義するには："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:612
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`New Signature Request` window, enable :guilabel:`Signing "
"Order`."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`新規署名申請`\\ ウィンドウで\\ :guilabel:`署名順序`\\ を有効に"
"します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:613
msgid ""
"Change the order by editing the number beside each signer, e.g., changing a "
"`3` to a `2` in the first column."
msgstr ""
"各署名者の横にある番号を編集して順序を変更します。たとえば、最初の列の`3`を"
"`2`に変更します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:616
msgid ""
"The signer indicated in position `1` receives the signature request first, "
"and each recipient receives the request only once the previous recipient has "
"signed the document."
msgstr ""
"位置`1`に指定された署名者が最初に署名申請を受け取り、各受信者は前の受信者がド"
"キュメントに署名した後にのみ申請を受け取ります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:620
msgid ""
"In the example, the AB & Co Legal contact will receive the signature request "
"first, the AB & Co CEO second, and Mitchell Admin last."
msgstr ""
"この例では、AB & Co Legal連絡先が最初に署名申請を受け取り、AB & Co CEOが2番"
"目、Mitchell Adminが直近に受け取ります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:623
msgid "Configuring signing order by editing the signer number"
msgstr "署名順序番号を編集して署名順序を設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:630
msgid "Validity dates and reminders"
msgstr "有効期限とリマインダー"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:632
msgid ""
"For documents that need to be signed within a certain timeframe, you can "
"indicate the last possible signing date using the :guilabel:`Valid Until` "
"field when configuring the signature request. After this date, the document "
"is no longer accessible via the link in the signature request email."
msgstr ""
"特定の期間内に署名する必要があるドキュメントの場合、署名申請を設定する際に"
"\\ :guilabel:`有効期限`\\ フィールドを使用して、署名可能な最終日を指定できま"
"す。この日付以降、ドキュメントは署名申請メールのリンクからアクセスできなくな"
"ります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:636
msgid "Set the number of days between reminders"
msgstr "リマインダー間の日数を設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:639
msgid "If the signature request does not expire, leave this field blank."
msgstr ""
"署名申請が期限切れにならない場合は、このフィールドを空白のままにします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:642
msgid ""
"When using a :ref:`template <sign/request-signatures/templates>` for which a "
"default validity period has been defined, the :guilabel:`Valid Until` date "
"is updated automatically in the signature request email; this date can be "
"changed if desired."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの有効期間が定義されている\\ :ref:`テンプレート <sign/request-"
"signatures/templates>`\\ を使用する場合、署名申請メールの\\ :guilabel:`有効期"
"限`\\ 日付は自動的に更新されます。この日付は必要に応じて変更できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:646
msgid ""
"To set automatic reminders, enable :guilabel:`Reminders`, then define the "
"interval, in days, at which reminders should be sent until the document has "
"been signed by the signer."
msgstr ""
"自動リマインダーを設定するには、\\ :guilabel:`リマインダー`\\ を有効にし、署"
"名者がドキュメントに署名するまでリマインダーを送信する間隔を日数で定義しま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/request_signatures.rst:652
