#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:83
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon in the "
"top-right of the card of a document, then click :guilabel:`Details`."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントのカードの右上にある\\ :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(縦の省略"
