#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:200
msgid ""
"By default, the list is a :ref:`dynamic list <spreadsheet/insert-list/static-"
"vs-dynamic>`, where the top-left cell contains an :ref:`Odoo-specific array "
"function <spreadsheet/insert-list/dynamic-function>` that retrieves data "
