#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:253
msgid "List properties"
msgstr "リストプロパティ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:255
msgid ""
"The list properties appear on the right side of the screen when a list is "
"inserted. They can be accessed at any time via the :guilabel:`Data` menu by "
"selecting the relevant list from the :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`List` "
"section, or by right-clicking anywhere on the list and clicking :icon:`oi-"
"view-list` :guilabel:`See list properties`."
msgstr ""
"リストを挿入すると、画面右側にリストプロパティが表示されます。これは、\\ "
":guilabel:`データ`\\ メニューの\\ :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`リスト`\\ "
"セクションから該当するリストを選択するか、リストの任意の場所を右クリックし"
"て\\ :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`リストプロパティを表示`\\ をクリックする"
"ことで、いつでもアクセスできます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:260
msgid "The following list properties are shown, some of which can be edited:"
msgstr "以下のリスト物件が表示され、一部は編集可能です:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:264
msgid ""
":guilabel:`List #`: the list ID, which is used to identify the list for the "
"lifetime of the spreadsheet. List IDs are assigned sequentially as "
"additional lists are inserted into the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`リスト #`：スプレッドシート内でリストを識別するために使用される"
"リストID。リストIDは、スプレッドシートに追加のリストが挿入されるにつれて連番"
"で割り当てられます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:268
msgid ""
":guilabel:`List Name`: the name of the list. Edit this if needed. Note that "
"editing the list name in the list properties does not modify the list name "
"shown in the sheet name, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`List Name`: リストの名前。必要に応じて編集します。リスト物件でリス"
"ト名を編集しても、シート名に表示されるリスト名は変更されず、その逆も同様で"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:271
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model`: the model from which the data has been extracted and the "
"total number of records in the model. The number of records is re-calculated "
"each time the spreadsheet is opened or each time the browser or spreadsheet "
"is refreshed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`モデル`：データの抽出元モデルおよびそのモデル内の総レコード数。"
"レコード数は、スプレッドシートを開くたび、またはブラウザやスプレッドシートを"
"更新するたびに再計算されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:275
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Columns`: the columns that were visible in the list view when the "
"list was inserted, or the list's default columns if the list was inserted "
"from the spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`列`：リスト挿入時にリストビューに表示されていた列、または"
"スプレッドシートからリストを挿入した場合はそのリストのデフォルトの列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sorting`: how the data is :ref:`sorted <spreadsheet/insert-list/"
"manipulate-sort>`, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`並べ替え`：該当する場合、データがどのように\\ :ref:`並べ替え "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/manipulate-sort>`\\ されているか。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Domain`: the rules used to determine which records are shown. "
"Click :guilabel:`Edit domain` to :ref:`add or edit rules <search/custom-"
"filters>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ドメイン`：表示するレコードを決定するために使用されるルール。\\ "
":guilabel:`ドメインを編集`\\ をクリックして\\ :ref:`ルールを追加または編集 "
"<search/custom-filters>`\\ します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:284
msgid ""
"To :ref:`duplicate <spreadsheet/insert-list/duplicate>` or :ref:`delete "
"<spreadsheet/insert-list/delete>` a list's data source, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon, then click :icon:`fa-"
"clone` :guilabel:`Duplicate` or :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Delete` as "
"relevant."
msgstr ""
