#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:66
msgid "Color scale"
msgstr "カラースケール"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:68
msgid ""
"With the range selected and :guilabel:`Color scale` selected as the rule "
"type:"
msgstr ""
"範囲を選択し、:guilabel:`カラースケール`\\ をルールタイプとして選択した場合:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:70
msgid ""
"Define what is used as the :guilabel:`Minpoint`, i.e., the lowest value, and "
"the :guilabel:`MaxPoint`, i.e., the highest value, by selecting the "
"appropriate category from the dropdown."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`最小値`\\ (最低値) および\\ :guilabel:`最大値`\\ (最高値) として使"
"用するものを、ドロップダウンから適切なカテゴリを選択して定義します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:73
msgid ""
"Optionally, to create a three-color scale, add a :guilabel:`MidPoint`, i.e., "
"the middle value."
msgstr ""
"オプションで、3色スケールを作成するには、:guilabel:`中間値`\\ (中央値) を追加"
"します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:74
msgid ""
"Define the color range by choosing a color for the lowest value, i.e., "
"the :guilabel:`Minpoint`, and the highest value, i.e., "
"the :guilabel:`MaxPoint`. For a three-color scale, also choose a color for "
"the :guilabel:`MidPoint`."
msgstr ""
"最低値 (:guilabel:`最小値`) と最高値 (:guilabel:`最大値`) の色を選択して、カ"
"ラー範囲を定義します。3色スケールの場合は、:guilabel:`中間値`\\ の色も選択し"
"ます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:80
msgid ""
"In the example, sales performance by salesperson is shown using a two-color "
"scale, with white representing the lowest value, and increasing amounts "
"intensifying in color towards the selected green color."
msgstr ""
"この例では、営業担当者別の販売実績が2色スケールで表示され、白が最低値を表し、"
"金額が増えるにつれて選択した緑色に向かって色が濃くなります。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:84
msgid ""
"Color scale conditional formatting showing sales performance by salesperson"
msgstr "営業担当者別の販売実績を示すカラースケール条件付き書式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:87
msgid ""
"Adding a :guilabel:`Midpoint`, with a corresponding color, allows you to "
"highlight performance in relation to a defined target or neutral value, "
"e.g., below or above a target %, or to distinguish between positive or "
"negative values."
msgstr ""
"対応する色とともに\\ :guilabel:`中間値`\\ を追加すると、定義された目標値また"
"は中立値に対する実績を強調表示できます (目標%を下回る/上回る、または正の値と"
"負の値を区別するなど)。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:94
msgid "Icon set"
msgstr "アイコン設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:96
msgid ""
"With the range selected and :guilabel:`Icon set` selected as the rule type:"
msgstr ""
"範囲を選択し、:guilabel:`アイコンセット`\\ をルールタイプとして選択した場合:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:98
msgid "Click on the set of :guilabel:`Icons` to use."
msgstr "使用する\\ :guilabel:`アイコン`\\ のセットをクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:99
msgid "For the first and second icons:"
msgstr "最初と2番目のアイコンについて："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:101
msgid "enter the value that represents the *lower* threshold for the icon"
msgstr "アイコンの\\ *下限*\\ しきい値を表す値を入力"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:102
msgid ""
"indicate whether the cell value must be `>` :guilabel:`(greater than)` or "
"`≥` :guilabel:`(greater than or equal to)` the threshold value"
msgstr ""
"セル値がしきい値に対して `>` :guilabel:`より大きい`または `≥` :guilabel:`以上"
"`のどちらであるべきかを指定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:104
msgid ""
"define whether the threshold value is "
"a :guilabel:`Number`, :guilabel:`Percentage`, :guilabel:`Percentile` "
"or :guilabel:`Formula`"
msgstr ""
"しきい値が:guilabel:`数値`、:guilabel:`パーセンテージ`、:guilabel:`パーセンタ"
"イル`、:guilabel:`数式`のいずれであるかを定義"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:107
msgid ""
"The third icon is added to all cells whose values are below the threshold "
"for the second icon."
msgstr ""
"3番目のアイコンは、2番目のアイコンのしきい値を下回るすべてのセルに追加されま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:110
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Reverse icons` to reverse the order of the icons."
msgstr ":guilabel:`反転`をクリックして、アイコンのオーダを逆にします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:115
msgid ""
"In the example, sales performance by salesperson is shown using a three-"
"scale set of colored dots:"
msgstr ""
"この例では、営業担当者別の販売実績が3段階の色付きドットで表示されています："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:118
msgid ""
"A **green** dot represents high performance, and is added to total sales "
"amounts *greater than or equal to* $50,000."
msgstr ""
"**緑色**のドットは高実績を表し、$50,000\\ *以上*\\ の売上合計金額に追加されま"
"す。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:120
msgid ""
"An **orange** dot represents average performance, and is added to total "
"sales amounts *greater than* $25,000 (but less than $50,000 as this is the "
"lower threshold for the green dot)."
msgstr ""
"**オレンジ色**のドットは平均的な実績を表し、$25,000\\ *より大きい*\\ 売上合計"
"金額に追加されます（ただし、緑色のドットの下限しきい値である$50,000未満）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:122
msgid ""
"A **red** dot represents low performance, and is added to all other amounts "
"(i.e., amounts below below $25,000 as this is the lower threshold for the "
"orange dot)."
msgstr ""
"**赤色**のドットは低実績を表し、その他すべての金額に追加されます（つまり、オ"
"レンジ色のドットの下限しきい値である$25,000未満の金額）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:125
msgid "Icon set conditional formatting applied to sales amounts"
msgstr "売上金額に適用されたアイコンセットの条件付き書式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:131
msgid "Data bar"
msgstr "データバー"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:134
msgid ""
"Unlike other conditional formatting rules in Odoo Spreadsheet, this rule "
"allows for the formatting to be applied either on the cells containing the "
"values the rule is based on, or on a corresponding range of cells, e.g., on "
"a column containing text. The :guilabel:`Apply to range` determines *where "
"the formatting is shown*, while the :guilabel:`Range of values` determines "
"which cells the rule is based on."
msgstr ""
"Odooスプレッドシートの他の条件付き書式ルールとは異なり、このルールでは、ルー"
"ルの基準となる値を含むセル、または対応するセル範囲（例：テキストを含む列）の"
"いずれかに書式を適用できます。:guilabel:`移動先`は\\ *書式が表示される場所"
"*\\ を決定し、:guilabel:`値の範囲`はルールの基準となるセルを決定します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:140
msgid "With :guilabel:`Data bar` selected as the rule type:"
msgstr "ルールタイプとして:guilabel:`データバー`を選択した状態で："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:142
msgid ""
"Click below :guilabel:`Apply to range`, then, in the spreadsheet, select the "
"range of cells *where the data bars should appear*. "
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`移動先`の下をクリックし、スプレッドシートで\\ *データバーを表示す"
"るセル範囲*\\ を選択します。:guilabel:`確定`をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:144
msgid ""
"Click on the :guilabel:`Color` dot to select the color of the data bars."
msgstr ":guilabel:`色`のドットをクリックして、データバーの色を選択します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:145
msgid ""
"Click below :guilabel:`Range of values`, then, in the spreadsheet, select "
"the range of cells *containing the values the rule should be based on*. "
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`値の範囲`の下をクリックし、スプレッドシートで\\ *ルールの基準とな"
"る値を含むセル範囲*\\ を選択します。:guilabel:`確定`をクリックします。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:150
msgid ""
"In the example, the rule is based on the `Total sales` amounts in column B "
"(with the :guilabel:`Range of values` being `B2:B14`), while the formatting "
"is applied on the `Salesperson` names in column A (with the :guilabel:`Apply "
"to range` being `A2:A14`)."
msgstr ""
"この例では、ルールは列Bの `Total sales` 金額に基づいており（:guilabel:`値の範"
"囲`は `B2:B14`）、書式は列Aの `Salesperson` 名に適用されています（:guilabel:`"
"移動先`は `A2:A14`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/visualize_data/conditional_formatting.rst:154
msgid "Data bar conditional formatting"
msgstr "データバーの条件付き書式"

