msgstr "\\ :guilabel:`フィルタ物件`\\ パネルを開いた状態で："

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:115
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:152
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:184
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:213
#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:232
