#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:301
msgid ""
"Global filters that have been configured are presented as cards. The icon "
"before the filter name indicates the :ref:`type of filter <spreadsheet/"
"global-filters/create-types>`: :icon:`fa-calendar` (Date), :icon:`fa-chain` "
