"集`\\ をクリックして、必要に応じて\\ :ref:`フィルタプロパティを編集 "
"<spreadsheet/global-filters/create-types>`\\ します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters.rst:318
msgid ""
"**Delete a global filter** by clicking the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` "
