#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:3
msgid "Pivot tables"
msgstr "ピボットテーブル"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:5
msgid ""
"Pivot tables allow you to organize, summarize, and analyze large amounts of "
"data without the need for complex formulas. By grouping and segmenting data "
"into :ref:`dimensions <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions>` (i.e., the "
"fields added as columns and rows) and defining what is being :ref:`measured "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>` (e.g., the total amount or quantity "
"ordered), the corresponding values of each intersecting data point are "
"calculated automatically."
msgstr ""
"ピボットテーブルを使用すると、複雑な数式を必要とせずに大量のデータを整理、要"
"約、分析できます。データを\\ :ref:`ディメンション <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/"
"dimensions>`(つまり列と行として追加されたフィールド)にグループ化およびセグメ"
"ント化し、何が\\ :ref:`測定 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>`\\ されている"
"か(例: 注文された合計金額や数量)を定義することで、各交差データポイントの対応"
"する値が自動的に計算されます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:12
msgid ""
"Various manipulations can be performed to see the same dataset from "
"different perspectives, such as :ref:`rearranging or sorting dimensions "
"<spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions>`, or :ref:`changing how measures are "
"aggregated or calculated <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>`."
msgstr ""
"同じデータセットを異なる視点から見るために、\\ :ref:`ディメンションの並べ替え"
"やソート <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/dimensions>`\\ や\\ :ref:`メジャーの集計方"
"法や計算方法の変更 <spreadsheet/pivot-tables/measures>`\\ など、さまざまな操"
"作を実行できます。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:17
msgid ""
"In the example, the pivot table shows the :guilabel:`Total` amount of sales "
"orders per salesperson per quarter. The :guilabel:`Salesperson` field is "
"represented in rows, the :guilabel:`Order Date` (grouped by quarter and "
"year) in columns, while the values represent the total amount for the given "
"salesperson and quarter."
msgstr ""
"この例では、ピボットテーブルは四半期ごとの営業担当者ごとの販売オーダの"
"\\ :guilabel:`合計`\\ 金額を示しています。\\ :guilabel:`営業担当者`\\ フィー"
"ルドは行に、\\ :guilabel:`オーダ日`(四半期と年でグループ化)は列に表示され、値"
"は指定された営業担当者と四半期の合計金額を表します。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:22
msgid "Pivot table showing sales per salesperson per quarter"
msgstr "四半期ごとの営業担当者ごとの売上を示すピボットテーブル"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/work_with_data/pivot_tables.rst:25
